OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of raping   
OL,4,Awoman                                  
OL,6,FA police officer has been convicted of 
OL,7,Frape and controlling and coercive      
OL,8,Fbehaviour.                             
OL,10,FAvon and Somerset PC Stephen Phipps was
OL,11,Ffound guilty of the two offences and   
OL,12,Facquitted of two further offences of   
OL,13,Frape and sexual assault by a jury at   
OL,14,FExeter Crown Court earlier.            
OL,16,FThe 45-year-old, of Bridgwater in      
OL,17,FSomerset, was arrested and immediately 
OL,18,Fsuspended after the victim reported the
OL,19,Foffences in February 2023. The force   
OL,20,Falso referred itself to the Independent
OL,21,FOffice for Police Conduct.             
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
