OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of raping   
OL,4,Awoman                                  
OL,6,FDeputy Chief Constable Jon Reilly said:
OL,7,F"Stephen Phipps abused and controlled  
OL,8,Fthe victim over a prolonged period     
OL,9,Fbefore subjecting her to an horrific   
OL,10,Fsexual offence. His actions were       
OL,11,Fappalling."                            
